# Codex Atlas — gitignore
# Original by John (~21:00 2026-05-14); extended by opus-housekeeper-2 (~21:35).
# Posture: track everything that's source-of-truth or human-edited; ignore
# regenerable artifacts, per-user state, and OS noise. The vault is private
# (no remote yet) — keep it that way until John explicitly publishes.

# === macOS metadata ===
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# === Python bytecode ===
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# === Auto-regenerable Wikipedia thumbnail cache (rebuilt by fetch_thumbnails.py) ===
_assets/thumbs_cache.json
_assets/thumbs/

# === Offline basemap tiles (re-fetchable via scripts/fetch-basemap.sh; 185 MB at z0-z7) ===
_assets/basemap/*.pmtiles

# === Project-local CLI binaries (re-fetchable via scripts/fetch-basemap.sh) ===
_assets/vendor/bin/

# === Pre-refactor backup of index.html (the Phase A monolith); keep only the new src/ layout ===
index.html.bak
*.bak

# === Generated atlas-app data (regenerable from build_data.py — 12MB) ===
data.js
# Phase 21AZ (2026-05-23) — CODEX v1.3 SFW/MAGNUM doctrine. data-sfw.js
# is the public-deploy artifact (regenerable from data.js via
# scripts/build_sfw.py). Never committed. The deploy step copies
# data-sfw.js → data.js on the production host; locally we keep the
# MAGNUM (full) data.js. See 00_meta/CODEX.md §IX.
data-sfw.js

# === Auto-generated per-phase TODO lists (regenerated by build_dashboard.py every batch) ===
02_documents/_phase-*/_TODO.md

# === Per-user / per-machine Obsidian state (the vault-wide config files ARE tracked) ===
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache

# === Editor / IDE noise ===
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.tmp
*~

# === Python venvs ===
.venv/
venv/

# === Node noise (in case of future Vite/bundler per AUDIT/10 §2.5) ===
node_modules/
.cache/
dist/
build/

# === Per-session Claude state ===
.claude/launch.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/projects/
.claude/*.lock

# === Ingest / audit working directory (generated analysis outputs) ===
99_ingest/

# === John's private art-direction workbench (2026-05-22) ===
# Raw BG videos / mockups / experiment files live here. THIS FOLDER
# IS OWNED BY JOHN — agents must NOT modify it. When an asset is
# implemented in the website, copy (don't move) it into _assets/bg/
# (or the appropriate _assets/ subfolder) with a stable filename, and
# the website references the absorbed copy. John may move/rename
# files inside Art Direction at any time without breaking the site.
Art Direction/

# Note: the following ARE intentionally tracked (NOT in this gitignore):
#   - 00_meta/DASHBOARD.md, dead-links.md, quality-issues.md, orphan-nodes.md, canonical-slugs.md
#     (auto-generated but useful as historical snapshots — diff == real signal)
#   - .obsidian/{app,appearance,core-plugins,graph}.json (vault-wide config — populated by opus-housekeeper-1)
#   - _assets/ screenshots (intentional visual-evolution history per AUDIT/10)
#   - AGENTS.md, README.md, AUDIT/, 00_meta/ (everything human-edited)

# === Secrets & credentials (never commit) — added 2026-06-26 pre-push privacy gate ===
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
credentials.json
secrets.json
*.secret
.npmrc
.netrc

# === Per-machine Claude config (path/identity-bearing; workflows stay tracked) ===
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
